### [파일 용도] 인증 API 테스트 (IntelliJ HTTP Client)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 회원가입
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickname": "테스터"
}

###

### 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### AccessToken 재발급 (로그인 후 refreshToken 복사해서 넣기)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwidHlwZSI6ImFjY2VzcyIsImlhdCI6MTc3MzY1NTY1MCwiZXhwIjoxNzczNjU2NTUwfQ.PsFfddCH8LQO4Bz7EQso_QhHRBB1xSCfl4uybDn-cZjJ_qMj28TbMJhIYqCmjJt3"
}

###

### 로그아웃 (로그인 후 accessToken 복사해서 넣기)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer 여기에_access_token_붙여넣기
